{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]Corrine, Corrina; Where've you been so long?
Tell me, [Eb]Cor-rina; Where've you been so [Bb]long?
[Bb]Ain't had no [F7]lovin'; Since you've been [Bb]gone.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
